subject: Reset your Detag password

--- text ---
Hi,

You asked to reset your Detag password. Open this link to choose a new one:

http://localhost:8080/auth/reset-password?token=tok-abc-123

The link expires in 30 minutes and can only be used once. If you did not ask for a reset, you can ignore this email — your password is unchanged.

— The Detag team

